    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759840/extras/a76df1d161bf938660aba53c31370ad8.avif?t=1737362089\" width=600 height=225 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759840/extras/2e291fbef310a750d92d425d0e47c742.poster.avif?t=1737362089\" width=500 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759840/extras/2e291fbef310a750d92d425d0e47c742.webm?t=1737362089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759840/extras/2e291fbef310a750d92d425d0e47c742.mp4?t=1737362089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\t&quot;Hell Knight&quot; is a roguelike deckbuilding game!<br></li><li>\tYou don't have to fight, just choose and judge!<br></li><li>\tBut don't take it lightly, your decisions will either lead your knight to his death, or make him ridiculously powerful.</li></ul><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759840/extras/2dc0c4fcc75829cc2e8ea4c5e4127431.avif?t=1737362089\" width=600 height=225 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759840/extras/8358e5465d64a113a57ff6e2988a9965.poster.avif?t=1737362089\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759840/extras/8358e5465d64a113a57ff6e2988a9965.webm?t=1737362089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759840/extras/8358e5465d64a113a57ff6e2988a9965.mp4?t=1737362089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tYes! You can build many different kinds of decks to strengthen your knight.<br></li><li>\tA single attack from a Knight can take down the final boss.<br></li><li>\tUse your judgment to strengthen your knights!</li></ul><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759840/extras/639ebeefe118b4f388849f3dee7ae31e.avif?t=1737362089\" width=600 height=225 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759840/extras/4ed210c09711ddcfb3c171fe2341d46f.poster.avif?t=1737362089\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759840/extras/4ed210c09711ddcfb3c171fe2341d46f.webm?t=1737362089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759840/extras/4ed210c09711ddcfb3c171fe2341d46f.mp4?t=1737362089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tJust play the game! You'll see how simple yet deep this game is.</li></ul>",
